<section class="hero-home">
        <div class="hero-panel">
            <div class="hero-copy">
                <span class="hero-kicker">Hospital matching for international patients</span>
                <h1>Find the Right Hospital in China.<br>Before You Fly.</h1>
                <p>Tell us about your condition, and we'll match you to <strong>2–3 verified hospitals</strong> selected for your case — not a generic ranking — with transparent cost estimates, English-speaking international departments, and clear next steps. <strong>Free</strong> case review, response within 24 hours.</p>
                <div class="hero-actions">
                    <a href="contact-new.html" class="cta-button">Start Free Case Review</a>
                    <a href="pricing.html" class="cta-button alt">View Pricing</a>
                </div>
                <form id="matchForm" action="contact-new.html" method="get" class="match-quick" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:26px 0 6px;max-width:780px;">
                    <select name="treatment" required aria-label="Treatment needed" style="flex:1 1 210px;min-width:0;padding:13px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);background:rgba(255,255,255,.97);color:#1e3c72;font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:600;">
                        <option value="">What treatment? *</option>
                        <option>Cancer Treatment / Oncology</option>
                        <option>Proton Therapy</option>
                        <option>Cardiac Surgery / Cardiology</option>
                        <option>Orthopedics / Joint Replacement</option>
                        <option>Neurology / Neurosurgery</option>
                        <option>IVF / Fertility Treatment</option>
                        <option>Eye Surgery / LASIK</option>
                        <option>Dental Treatment</option>
                        <option>Traditional Chinese Medicine</option>
                        <option>General Health Checkup</option>
                        <option>Other</option>
                    </select>
                    <select name="country" aria-label="Country" style="flex:1 1 170px;min-width:0;padding:13px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);background:rgba(255,255,255,.97);color:#1e3c72;font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:600;">
                        <option value="">Where are you from?</option>
                        <option>United States</option>
                        <option>United Kingdom</option>
                        <option>Canada</option>
                        <option>Australia</option>
                        <option>Singapore</option>
                        <option>Malaysia</option>
                        <option>Indonesia</option>
                        <option>Philippines</option>
                        <option>Thailand</option>
                        <option>Vietnam</option>
                        <option>Russia</option>
                        <option>Middle East</option>
                        <option>Other</option>
                    </select>
                    <select name="budget" aria-label="Budget" style="flex:1 1 150px;min-width:0;padding:13px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.35);background:rgba(255,255,255,.97);color:#1e3c72;font-size:0.95rem;font-weight:600;">
                        <option value="">Budget?</option>
                        <option>Under $5k</option>
                        <option>$5k–$15k</option>
                        <option>$15k–$50k</option>
                        <option>$50k+</option>
                        <option>Not sure</option>
                    </select>
                    <button type="submit" style="flex:0 0 auto;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#b78a42 0%,#d4a84b 100%);color:#fff;border:none;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700;font-size:0.98rem;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;">Get My Hospital Match →</button>
                </form>
                <p style="margin:6px 0 0;font-size:0.8rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);">No charge, no commitment. You'll get 2–3 hospital matches and a cost estimate.</p>
                <div class="hero-metrics">
                    <div class="hero-metric"><strong>Independently Matched</strong><span>We select hospitals based on your condition, not commissions or a single ranking</span></div>
                    <div class="hero-metric"><strong>2–3 Hospitals</strong><span>Each review returns a shortlist matched to your case</span></div>
                    <div class="hero-metric"><strong>Verified Data</strong><span>Hospital listings carry verification dates</span></div>
                    <div class="hero-metric"><strong>24h Response</strong><span>Free case review answered within 24h (business days)</span></div>
                </div>
                <div class="trust-badges">
                    <div class="badge"><span class="badge-icon">&#x1F3E5;</span> Independent &amp; Unbiased</div>
                    <div class="badge"><span class="badge-icon">&#x1F4CB;</span> No Hospital Commissions</div>
                    <div class="badge"><span class="badge-icon">&#x1F310;</span> International Patient Focus</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="band">
        <div class="section-shell">
            <h2 class="section-title">Why China Leads in Medicine</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">Independent evidence — not marketing. Here's what sets China's top hospitals apart from anywhere else in the world.</p>
            <div class="journey-grid" style="grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)">
                <div class="journey-card">
                    <div style="font-size:2em;margin-bottom:12px">🏆</div>
                    <h3>Proven Clinical Excellence</h3>
                    <p>Hospitals in our network are evaluated across <strong>multiple quality frameworks</strong>: the national <strong>Grade 3A classification</strong>, <strong>JCI accreditation</strong>, specialty rankings from Fudan University and the Chinese Academy of Medical Sciences, and — most importantly — <strong>clinical outcome data and surgical volume</strong>. Top departments in cardiac surgery, oncology, ophthalmology, and orthopedics compete with the best hospitals globally.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="journey-card">
                    <div style="font-size:2em;margin-bottom:12px">🔬</div>
                    <h3>Technology at the Frontier</h3>
                    <p>China has <strong>7 approved CAR-T cell therapies</strong> — among the most of any nation — including the <strong>world's first CAR-T for solid tumors</strong> (satri-cel, approved June 2026). Chinese hospitals performed the <strong>first fully autonomous robotic dental implant</strong>, run some of the world's largest <strong>CRISPR clinical trial programs</strong>, and operate a rapidly growing network of <strong>proton therapy centers</strong>.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="journey-card">
                    <div style="font-size:2em;margin-bottom:12px">👨‍⚕️</div>
                    <h3>Why Surgical Volume Matters</h3>
                    <p>A surgeon at Fuwai Hospital performs <strong>over 15,000 cardiac surgeries a year</strong>. At Zhongshan Ophthalmic Center, surgeons complete <strong>20,000+ refractive surgeries annually</strong>. Higher procedure volume can be an important signal of specialist experience — but volume alone should never determine a hospital or surgeon choice.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="journey-card">
                    <div style="font-size:2em;margin-bottom:12px">🌿</div>
                    <h3>Integrated Medicine — Unique to China</h3>
                    <p>No other country delivers <strong>acupuncture, herbal medicine, and Western surgery</strong> under one hospital roof as standard care. Chinese hospitals integrate TCM into oncology (reducing chemo side effects), orthopedics (accelerating post-surgical recovery), and cardiac rehabilitation. It's not alternative medicine — it's <strong>state-sponsored, evidence-based integration</strong>.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="journey-card">
                    <div style="font-size:2em;margin-bottom:12px">⚡</div>
                    <h3>Shorter Scheduling — Typically 2–4 Weeks</h3>
                    <p>In countries like the UK and Canada, patients can wait <strong>6–12 months</strong> for joint replacement or cardiac surgery. At China's top hospitals, international patients are often scheduled within <strong>2–4 weeks</strong> — but availability depends on your case, so we confirm it with each hospital before you travel.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="journey-card">
                    <div style="font-size:2em;margin-bottom:12px">💡</div>
                    <h3>Transparent Pricing — 50–70% Less</h3>
                    <p>Knee replacement: <strong>$5,500–$9,000</strong> (vs $35,000+ in the US). CAR-T: <strong>$30,000–$89,000</strong> (vs $375,000+). LASIK: <strong>$800–$1,500</strong> (vs $2,000+). These are <strong>estimated ranges</strong> — final pricing depends on your diagnosis, materials, length of stay, and hospital assessment. We confirm figures with each hospital before you travel.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- REGIONAL VALUE COMPARISON STRIP -->
    <section class="section-shell" style="padding-bottom:20px">
        <h2 class="section-title">China vs The Rest of Asia — Cost Comparison</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">Over <strong>5.5 million international patients</strong> travel to Asia each year for surgery. Here's how China stacks up against the other major destinations for the procedures that matter most.</p>
        <div class="region-compare">
            <div class="rc-header">
                <div class="rc-label">Procedure</div>
                <div class="rc-country best">🇨🇳 China</div>
                <div class="rc-country">🇹🇭 Thailand</div>
                <div class="rc-country">🇲🇾 Malaysia</div>
                <div class="rc-country">🇸🇬 Singapore</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rc-row">
                <div class="rc-label">Heart Bypass (CABG)</div>
                <div class="rc-val best">$10K–$16K</div>
                <div class="rc-val">$18K–$25K</div>
                <div class="rc-val">$14K–$20K</div>
                <div class="rc-val">$28K–$42K</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rc-row">
                <div class="rc-label">Knee Replacement</div>
                <div class="rc-val best">$5.5K–$9K</div>
                <div class="rc-val">$12K–$18K</div>
                <div class="rc-val">$9K–$15K</div>
                <div class="rc-val">$18K–$28K</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rc-row">
                <div class="rc-label">Spinal Fusion (1–2 lvls)</div>
                <div class="rc-val best">$8K–$14K</div>
                <div class="rc-val">$16K–$25K</div>
                <div class="rc-val">$12K–$20K</div>
                <div class="rc-val">$25K–$38K</div>
            </div>
            <div class="rc-row">
                <div class="rc-label">CAR-T Therapy</div>
                <div class="rc-val best">$30K–$89K</div>
                <div class="rc-val">Limited</div>
                <div class="rc-val">Limited</div>
                <div class="rc-val">$250K–$375K</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p style="text-align:center;margin-top:10px;color:#888;font-size:.88rem">China: <strong style="color:#2e7d32">30–60% cheaper</strong> than Thailand for major surgery · ~410K inbound medical tourists (2025, est.) · 40+ JCI hospitals · <a href="/compare/" style="color:#1e3c72;font-weight:600">Full comparison with 15+ procedures →</a></p>
    </section>

    <section class="band">
        <div class="section-shell">
            <h2 class="section-title">How We Help</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">We help you understand your options before you commit to treatment travel.</p>
            <div class="journey-grid">
                <div class="journey-card">
                    <div class="step-badge">1</div>
                    <h3>Tell us about your case</h3>
                    <p>Fill out a short form about your condition, timing, and budget. No commitment — we review it free and let you know if we can help.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="journey-card">
                    <div class="step-badge">2</div>
                    <h3>Get a personalized shortlist</h3>
                    <p>Within 24 hours, you receive <strong>2-3 accredited hospitals</strong> matched to your case — selected across multiple quality standards — with cost estimates, surgeon backgrounds, and practical travel notes.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="journey-card">
                    <div class="step-badge">3</div>
                    <h3>We handle the rest — or you go on your own</h3>
                    <p>Want us to contact hospitals, translate responses, and coordinate appointments? We'll do it. Prefer to go solo? Take the shortlist and run. <strong>Your call.</strong></p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-shell" style="padding-bottom:36px">
        <h2 class="section-title">How We Select Hospitals</h2>
        <p class="section-lead">Not a single ranking — six quality signals. Every hospital we recommend must clear multiple bars.</p>
        <div class="how-select-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px">
            <div class="journey-card" style="padding:22px 20px">
                <div style="font-size:1.8em;margin-bottom:8px">🏥</div>
                <h3>National Grade 3A</h3>
                <p>China's highest hospital tier — reserved for tertiary centers with advanced facilities and specialist departments.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="journey-card" style="padding:22px 20px">
                <div style="font-size:1.8em;margin-bottom:8px">🌐</div>
                <h3>JCI Accreditation</h3>
                <p>Joint Commission International — the global benchmark for patient safety, clinical quality, and international standards.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="journey-card" style="padding:22px 20px">
                <div style="font-size:1.8em;margin-bottom:8px">📊</div>
                <h3>Specialty Rankings</h3>
                <p>Cross-referenced: Fudan University, Chinese Academy of Medical Sciences, and discipline-specific national rankings.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="journey-card" style="padding:22px 20px">
                <div style="font-size:1.8em;margin-bottom:8px">👨‍⚕️</div>
                <h3>Surgical Volume</h3>
                <p>Procedure volume is one of several signals we weigh — a useful indicator of specialist experience, but never the deciding factor on its own.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="journey-card" style="padding:22px 20px">
                <div style="font-size:1.8em;margin-bottom:8px">🗣️</div>
                <h3>International Dept.</h3>
                <p>English-speaking staff, dedicated international patient floors, and experience with cross-border medical travelers.</p>
            </div>
